---

pg-embedding-gen-by-yhw is a PostgreSQL 18.x extension that generates text
embedding vectors via SQL functions by calling any OpenAI-compatible
/v1/embeddings API endpoint. It supports multi-model profile management,
automatic vector dimension detection, cosine similarity and Euclidean distance
calculation, health checking, and request logging — all without requiring
C extension compilation, using PostgreSQL 18's COPY FROM PROGRAM mechanism.

